{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yululu-e-f4f8a2b560501c93681f","title":"裴松之驳《江表传》虞翻说华歆的名德与降服解释","accounts":[{"id":"yululu-a-f4f8a2b560501c93681f","label":"裴松之按语","text":"裴松之驳《江表传》虞翻说华歆的名德与降服解释","evidence":["yululu-q-a5af5ed09e6aa4367926"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["yululu-q-a5af5ed09e6aa4367926"]},"ordering_evidence":"yululu-q-a5af5ed09e6aa4367926","related_events":[{"event":"yululu-e-6bef39fb7ecfd5ae794a","type":"disputes","evidence":["yululu-q-a5af5ed09e6aa4367926","yululu-q-dae5c32510942706995c"]}],"order":10071},{"id":"yululu-e-6bef39fb7ecfd5ae794a","title":"翻径到豫章与华歆相见，以名声、资粮、士民三问折歆，告大军已次椒丘，限明日日中迎檄","accounts":[{"id":"yululu-a-6bef39fb7ecfd5ae794a","label":"裴注·《江表传》","text":"翻径到豫章与华歆相见，以名声、资粮、士民三问折歆，告大军已次椒丘，限明日日中迎檄","evidence":["yululu-q-dae5c32510942706995c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhouyu-p0058","role":"说降","evidence":["yululu-q-dae5c32510942706995c"]},{"person":"wudi-p0340","role":"被说","evidence":["yululu-q-dae5c32510942706995c"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["yululu-q-dae5c32510942706995c"]},"ordering_evidence":"yululu-q-dae5c32510942706995c","related_events":[{"event":"yululu-e-f4f8a2b560501c93681f","type":"disputes","evidence":["yululu-q-a5af5ed09e6aa4367926","yululu-q-dae5c32510942706995c"]},{"event":"yululu-e-f176f29f40940be00bd2","type":"alternative","evidence":["yululu-q-f6a814cd4ff413abc719","yululu-q-dae5c32510942706995c"]}],"order":10066}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"yululu-q-a5af5ed09e6aa4367926","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-67a4e558dfe13f19969e","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以为：王、华二公于扰攘之时，抗猛锐之锋，俱非所能。歆之名德，实高于朗；而《江表传》述翻说华，云“海内名声，孰与于王”，此言非也。然王公拒战，华逆请服；实由孙策初起，名微众寡。故王能举兵，岂武胜哉！策后威力转盛，势不可敌；华量力而止，非必用仲翔之说也。若使易地而居，亦华战王服耳。","attribution":"裴松之按语","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-ce266c64f23561990ea9","start":0,"end":142},{"id":"yululu-q-dae5c32510942706995c","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-230a1207528cb2e4c890","layer":"pei","quote":"翻即奉命辞行，径到郡，请被褠葛巾与敌相见。谓歆曰：‘君自料名声之在海内，孰与鄙郡故王府君？’歆曰：‘不及也！’翻曰：‘豫章资粮多少，器仗精否，士民勇果孰与鄙郡？’又曰：‘不如也！’翻曰：‘讨逆将军智略超世，用兵如神：前走刘扬州，君所亲见；南定鄙郡，亦君所闻也。今欲守孤城，自料资粮，已知不足；不早为计，悔无及也！今大军已次椒丘，仆便还去；明日日中迎檄不到者，与君辞矣","attribution":"裴注·《江表传》","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-ce266c64f23561990ea9","start":81,"end":264}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
